  "base_for_increment": "7db43e41 (PR #33 head)",
  "summary": "Lean PPML two-FE protocol on top of the PR #33 CMG reuse: publication fits enter the strict checkpoint once the predictor is predicted to settle within the strict envelope; canonical products reuse (and lazily build or refresh) the CMG hierarchy, solve small components directly and skip unaffordable dense assembly; joint frames check original inputs over fixed parallel leaves, reconstruct from the projected bank and form Gram and initial scores in one tiled pass; canonical refinement, dense product writes and coupling preparation run in parallel."
